// FurPass != 0 = split entries (two Impl passes: the main chunk and the GBuffer custom-output chunk the Kuro PS re-evaluates);
// Forms = WUWA_V2F_* expression-order bits of pass 1 / pass 2 (Forms2); bFurry = UseFurry (fur clip + PixelDepthOffset output,
// pass 2 at the post-PDO world position); bParallax = UseFurryParallax (material textures at the parallax UV, WuwaV2BodyParallaxUV).

